{"ref":"BDB, נֶ֫דֶר","hw":"נֶ֫דֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫דֶר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵ֫דֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:5\" href=\"/Numbers.30.5\">Nu 30:5</a></sup> <strong>vow</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫דֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:20\" href=\"/Genesis.28.20\">Gn 28:20</a> + 17 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵ֫דֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:10\" href=\"/Numbers.30.10\">Nu 30:10</a> + 4 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִדְרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.7\">2 S 15:7</a> + 5 times sfs.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:16\" href=\"/Jonah.1.16\">Jon 1:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.25\">Pr 20:25</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדָרַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:26\" href=\"/Psalms.22.26\">ψ 22:26</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">נִדְרֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.18\">Lv 22:18</a> + 24 times sfs.;—<em>vow:</em><br><strong>1.</strong>  of personal service to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:20\" href=\"/Genesis.28.20\">Gn 28:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:13\" href=\"/Genesis.31.13\">31:13</a> (of Jacob at Bethel), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.7\">2 S 15:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.8\">8</a> (at Hebron); <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.2\">Lv 27:2</a> (P, any one), of Nazirite <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:2\" href=\"/Numbers.6.2\">Nu 6:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:5\" href=\"/Numbers.6.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:21\" href=\"/Numbers.6.21\">21</a>; Hannah’s consecration of her son <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.11\">1 S 1:11</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בר נדרי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.2\">Pr 31:2</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  in gen. of any kind of votive offerings or promised gifts to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:3\" hre